<title>USA: Northport terminates Great Eastern offer.</title>
<headline>Northport terminates Great Eastern offer.</headline>
<dateline>OKLAHOMA CITY 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northport Operating Co LC, an affiliate of Northport Prodution Co, said Monday it had terminated its cash tender offer for up to 100 percent of the shares of Great Eastern Energy and Development Corp.</p>
<p>It said the offer was not recommended by Great Eastern's board.</p>
<p>Northport said Great Eastern had accepted an initial tender offer submitted by Caprito Gas Corp of $0.22 a share.</p>
<p>Northport has offered $0.23 a share for Great Eastern.</p>
</text>
